===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*gʰreh₁-}}
{{etymon|en|id=color|inh|enm>grene>green|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|grene}}, from {{inh|en|ang|grēne}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*grōnī}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*grōniz}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*gʰreh₁-||to grow}}. More at [[grow]].

See also {{cog|frr|green}}, {{cog|fy|grien}}, {{cog|nl|groen}}, {{cog|nds|grön}}, {{m|nds|green}}, {{m|nds-de|greun}}, {{cog|de|grün}}, {{cog|da|-}} and {{cog|nn|grøn}}, {{cog|sv|grön}}, {{cog|nb|grønn}}, {{cog|is|grænn}}.

